              "text": "લપેટવું (lapeṭvũ) is a tadbhava. It comes from lappēṭṭ, \"wrap\", a reconstructed form, and CDIAL glosses the Gujarati verb \"to wrap, fold, wind\" (CDIAL 10942)."
