          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "બચવું (bacvũ) goes back to Sanskrit váñcati, \"moves; escapes from\", but CDIAL marks the Gujarati verb, glossed \"to escape\", as borrowed from Hindi bacnā, \"to escape\"; the taught bacāvvũ, \"to save\", is its causative (CDIAL 11208)."
            }
          ]
        },
